WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Library Story Time. Silent clip.]

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Gus arrives to read a picture book to the children.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.600
Gus honks at full volume. Story time is over.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.600
Everyone sprints for the exits. One child is still holding the book.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.000
Gus has been asked to stay in the parking lot next time.
